# Copied to public/.assetsignore by `npm run build`. Patterns here are
# excluded from the Cloudflare static-assets upload (gitignore syntax).
#
# WHY: the @cloudflare/vite-plugin worker build is emitted into
# public/rsss/, and that output includes a generated .dev.vars (real
# secrets) plus wrangler.json. The assets directory is ./public, so
# without this file wrangler would publish those at /rsss/.dev.vars etc.
# Source maps are dev-only and must not be served publicly either.

.dev.vars
wrangler.json
rsss/
*.map
